<title>POLAND: Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven stocks fell, five rose and six were flat in 7.1-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday.</p>
<p>The remaining three stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units eased 0.6 percent in a 16.2-million- zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
